ata-tex=\"2\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n<li>Why does the uniqueness half need only an induction, while existence\nneeds partial solutions?</li>\n<li>State the idea of the proof in two sentences.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch1/recursion-and-arithmetic.html"}